Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we will find suspense And then commence\Nto live out another day so intense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams and you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This rock guy doesn't want\Nto let us go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I told you, Fika\Ncontrols the entire palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky he hasn't crushed us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure your friend will\Nbe okay? Zoro? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do great. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NZoro will pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the trick here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some place that can cut\Nthis bastard that'll take him down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got another executive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a member of the Pika Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't beat him in your current form.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rampo and I will draw his\Nattention and you run ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have you sacrifice\Nyourselves on my behalf! Rampo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll attack from both\Nsides at once! Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm stuck\Nexterminating these rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think a toy can outrun me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the pop-pop fruit\Nand became a rupture man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can detonate my body\Nwithout causing harm to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can also detonate anything inorganic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Though a toy like you\Nwon't survive the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is counting on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're ready\Nto burst, little toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier, have you seen my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky made it sound like he was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can talk later, Starhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You little traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for turning your\Nback on the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run. Trust me. He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just head for the suit chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Viola, you're helping us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You recognize me? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm sure that\Nyou've forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been watching you with my\Nclairvoyance for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Rebecca as well. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treachery won't\Ngo unpunished, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been on your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You give yourself too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For ten whole years, I've been\Nwaiting for this opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hear your\Nvenomous words any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Helmet, pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Viola! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should've caught that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't get hurt too bad, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter how we get there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The staircase is the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Doflamingo family\Ncalls him young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some intruders in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to wait upstairs\Nuntil we take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall do no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You may do as you wish with the\Nintruders, but I'm heading underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have business with Kanjido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai who disappeared\Nfrom the junkyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say he went missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly was\Neffective, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to wait first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry, and now we have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo is right. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tontara still need time to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your only objective
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,was to destroy the Smile Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So what about Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His crew is teaming up\Nwith the little people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,from Green Bit—would\Nyou mind telling me why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for them, that\Nseems a bit capricious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Little people—while you're at it—tell me\Nhow they snuck into the underground port.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,they decide to target Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out their motivations\Nor how they arrived at this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're doing a good job of\Npissing me off at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking like... it's looking like
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,more than a simple coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that would mean they know\Nabout this kingdom's dark secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master's speaking to you, Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it if it's gonna make you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, you two never change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything\Nto do with them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our alliance ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever they're doing out\Nthere, it's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity Violet isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She could see right through\Nyou if you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you wouldn't happen to know\Nanything about this, would you, King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tontada were rather\Nfond of you, if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy's okay. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, after all these\Nyears, you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Kiros, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go kick Mingo's ass already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have to wait for the Tontara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Our window for victory is narrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but as long as he can restore\Nthe toys to their human form,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have my chance to strike\Ndown Doflamingo once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends put their lives\Non the line to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not fail, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Usoland!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give yourself up, Franky,\Nor we'll fire until you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you shut the hell up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go nuts and\Nwreck this place all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me why. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go underground with\Nthese chumps chasing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just gonna make\Nthings worse for the little
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,people I'm leaving operation\NSOP in your hands, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me everything you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's a wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we've got intruders.\NWe've also got master trebles and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,no big deal those poor bastards\Nonce you get on his bad side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,then you're as good as dead
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you guys take down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been turned into a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That means everyone\Nhas forgotten about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes, you\Nhave to fight a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were they trying so hard\Nto make me eat this grape?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably poison, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly smells terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything goes wrong, I'll\Njump in and take over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Usoland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! What happened? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I want to live. Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you. Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I write a book to tell\Nfuture generations how brave you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Honest Tantadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a name already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this is Frankie's fault anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he come here to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let myself get killed just because\Nyou guys think I'm some legendary hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got away from the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still need to find a\Nway out of this stupid place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably can't worm my way through the\Ntunnel without them carrying me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that there\Nwas a lift, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, can everybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a show?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't stop working, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Move those boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's standing up to\Nthe Don Quixote family!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a toy for eight years and\NI haven't seen this happen once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it all down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hell out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do with all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are they saying something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's... Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,U...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lund.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,U...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uso... Lund.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uso...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uso...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lund, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they hide you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uso...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lund, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uso...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lund...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Usuland?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Usuland?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that name before, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Usuland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an Usuland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is Usuland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a friend of the Tontada, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron, just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if you die first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't lose to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Usuland is our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's gonna come and\Nrescue you any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't quite strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll save this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll rescue the toys who were forced to\Nslave away day after day at this port.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's talking about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.20,0:16:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll reunite us with our friends\Nwho are held captive at the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll restore all the toys we're\Nforced to put on a happy face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll dry the tears and vanquish the\Ndarkness they have buried in their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the poor big people\Nwho don't even know what
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,they've lost Will be reunited\Nwith their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll save us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we have a real hero on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel sorry for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big hero lied to you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you saps got fooled again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're all beat up, this\NUsulang guy still isn't coming to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That says it all, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You think a real hero\Nwould leave you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But he told us he'd help\Nus if things got bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's not helping—I bet he's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're laughing at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet there's some coward\Nout there who told you he'd
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,make everything right\Nsomehow—whoever the heck he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I also bet he'd shake it\Nout as soon as things look bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so you might as well give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but he's right if you\Nwant some advice—do like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,advice do like Goosalantin,\Nget the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gol D. Roger will save us\Nbecause our hero doesn't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I'm a\Ndescendant of Noland. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew about Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So when he tells us he'll save\Nthe day, then we believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you're going\Nto be sorry real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A hero would never lie to us because\Na hero will always keep his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'd better stop insulting\NOozolent or you're really gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna laugh, better do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Oozolent gets here,\Nthen you're gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He said Piggya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you say when\Nyou die, huh? Piggya? Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What Leo said was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Usuland is on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll carry out Operation S.O.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll save all the Tantana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Piggya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be as cruel as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Piggya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see this hero of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that's not pretty bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Usalad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Usalad is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gustav, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you all trust me so\Nmuch, you little idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to be crushed! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I told you was a lie! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place, my name's not Usuland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not a legendary hero, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And my name is Usopp,\Nthe Invincible Sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a pirate,\Nyou still can be a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate's a pirate, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I\Nwas lying! Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me repeat myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop having so much faith in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You came all the way back\Nhere just to say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to let him know that you took them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, those fools would\Nwait around for me till they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happened, I wouldn't\Nbe able to sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to thank them for\Nbelieving in a guy like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to sacrifice\Nmyself for them, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much cooler than running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Usopp—you hear me, you better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember my name: Totanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die here fighting for you, you gotta\Nbuild a statue of me next to Nolan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask for a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sit back and watch\Nbecause I'm about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to You can't become one right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.07,0:22:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he's actually gonna save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances, special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant on us! Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck! Xunikin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck! Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's how a legendary hero does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for the\NSniper of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.68,0:22:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa-land, our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Usa, you little bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary hero, Usa-land!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.74,0:23:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a report that you\Nwere on the first floor, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was someone who looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell looks like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on. King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fine sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I turn back into a human,\Nthis will do, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was fighting\Nin the Coliseum today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.86,0:23:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The old king was spurred into action after\NDoflamingo lied about his abdication.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I decided to fight back like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.82,0:23:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick was fighting in the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a squabble in the slums.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:23:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Two people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The murderer is a teenage boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.24,0:24:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We have him surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.26,0:24:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's far too dangerous! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.35,0:24:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He might look like some young punk,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's known throughout the\Nwhole kingdom for his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.66,0:24:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is in danger! Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your guns down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.83,0:24:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But, my lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were in a terrible fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.56,0:24:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were all on your own\Nagainst dozens of angry thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.80,0:24:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, more than half\Nof them were badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And two were killed. That's true, but\Nthey ganged up on my best friend and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.58,0:25:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,murdered him i was only taking revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.38,0:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for his death what are you a beast call me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.08,0:25:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever you like you haven't lived\Nmy life you don't know a damn thing my
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.44,0:25:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,friend he was like a brother to me all\Nright he was the only person i ever trusted
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros was your name. Come with me, please
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.30,0:25:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The 15-year-old murderer, Kiros, is facing\Noff with one of our seasoned veterans.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This coliseum is a sacred place
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true skill If his blade wasn't\Nblunt, he would have killed that man
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.30,0:25:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd call it savagery,\Nbut here, it's skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Kiros doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.20,0:25:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He nearly killed all the convict\Ngladiators he was held with.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.96,0:25:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick is willing to release you on\Nparole if you're able to win 100 matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it takes years, that's\Nhow you may earn your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.98,0:26:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.89,0:26:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We won the consecutive victories!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.60,0:26:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even our strongest gladiators\Nfell before the might of Kiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.42,0:26:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in the league, but he's\Nwon his freedom in no time at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.30,0:26:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That killer doesn't deserve to be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.24,0:26:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.12,0:26:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go where I'm not wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You care about other people's\Nopinion all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.66,0:26:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known, people only like\Nbeasts, as long as they stay in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,200 victories!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody take that guy out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:26:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They can pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.44,0:27:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,300 victories!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The heroes line up one after another,\Nbut heroes cut them down to size!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.54,0:27:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are witnessing an\Nunprecedented 1 ,000 victories!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work! You're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear it again, Kiros. Listen. Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.28,0:27:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.40,0:27:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, for the\Nrest of my life, I'll be a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.54,0:27:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish this world would forget about me!
